    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">consists of N experts, each instantiated as an independent FFN.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">comprises a sparse gate network and a series of expert networks.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">by changing the memory vectors to input-dependent expert networks, PEER can achieve significantly higher efficiency than PKM.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The core of the MoE architecture comprises a set of expert networks governed by a routing strategy.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Since the experts are distributed across different devices, communication during this process i</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
