    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">dynamic expert loading mechanism that reduces latency through low-precision replacement of less critical cache-miss experts, maintaining accuracy and flexibility</hasEvidenceText>
