    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ncclReduceScatter + all2all instead of ncclAllReduce . For combine stage, we use all2all + ncclAllGather instead of ncclAllReduce</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
