    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">we highlight its system inefficiency. Layer-wise gating makes it difficult to predict which expert to load until runtime ( 4.1), and complicating request batching</hasEvidenceText>
